            <h1 class="news-title">從政四十年華麗轉身！高雄市議員陸淑美辦感恩晚會，交棒黃韻涵深耕地方</h1>

            <!-- 新聞資訊 -->
            <div class="d-flex flex-wrap justify-content-center text-muted gap-3 pb-2 mb-4 border-bottom">
